@@ -0,0 +1,50 @@
+# Activities
+
+Activities provide a chronological feed of events across boards the current user can access.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activity, newest first.
+
+### Query Parameters
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | array | No | Filter by one or more creator user IDs |
+| `board_ids[]` | array | No | Filter by one or more accessible board IDs |
+
+__Response:__
+
+```json
+[
+  {
+    "id": "03f5va03bpuvkcjemcxl73ho2",
+    "action": "card_title_changed",
+    "eventable_type": "Card",
+    "created_at": "2025-11-19T04:03:58.000Z",
+    "description": "David Heinemeier Hansson renamed \"New Title\" (was: \"Old Title\")",
+    "particulars": {
+      "old_title": "Old Title",
+      "new_title": "New Title"
+    },
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/cards/1",
+    "eventable": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zo9qlcwwpyc0ascnikz",
+      "number": 1,
+      "title": "New Title",
+      "status": "published"
+    },
+    "board": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcy",
+      "name": "Fizzy",
+      "all_access": true
+    },
+    "creator": {
+      "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+      "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+      "role": "owner",
+      "active": true
+    }
+  }
+]
+```
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
